# Intent: Settings at finger size (owner review 2026-11-18, the physical standard in docs/design/screen-style.md). The tab column is a scrolling column of 56 px tabs on a 64 px pitch (three show, the fourth peeks, the chosen tab is scrolled into view); Done is 72 by 48 at the top right; every list row is 56 px with an 8 px gap; the style tiles are 56 px; row labels and values are the 20 px body text; a slider's grab area is 56 px; the Faces tab shows only the tile rows it needs (three styles are two rows). Display only: no safety, lock, cue, limiter or head-motion code.
# Placement: unit
# Upstream: firmware/main/hal/maipai_apps.cc, maipai_apps_core.h (ours)
# Check after a flash: Settings shows three tabs and a part of the fourth, each tab easy to press; Done at the top right; the General rows are one finger tall with a gap between; the sliders move from anywhere along a thumb-high band; the Faces tab shows the three styles in two rows.
# Kconfig: none

